    "body": "## Summary\n- update `stripe-java` from 24.8.0 to 33.3.0\n- align local webhook event deserialization with the current Stripe API generation used by the account/CLI\n\n## Why\nLocal test payments succeed in Stripe, but `StripeWebhookController` logs `Unable to deserialize Stripe event ... of type payment_intent.succeeded` before wallet crediting. The old SDK was pinned to an API generation from 2023, while current Stripe events use a much newer schema.\n\n## Validation\nRun the full API/web/runtime CI and payments-ledger smoke. Do not merge unless all required checks are green.",
